     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This is actually a more general error: I can reproduce just by running fedora-rebuild.sh with included Derby database.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It also looks like this problem has been around for some time now. I can reproduce it as far back as 95cec2340fd7c026d95016eb3b24987de63ef803 (24 April). Still haven't narrowed down when it appeared.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
